<title>USA: Kennewick, Wash., won by Seattle-Northwest.</title>
<headline>Kennewick, Wash., won by Seattle-Northwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it won $5.9 million of Kennewick, Wash., general obligation bonds of 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.291 percent.</p>
</text>
